data structure is a simple way of organizing data so we can perform operations on it.

their are several types of data structures:

| Data structure | Example                     |
| -------------- | --------------------------- |
| Array/List     |  [1, 2, 3]                  |
| String         |   "hello"                   |
| Hash Map       |  {"apple": 3}               |
| Set            |  {1, 2, 3}                  |
| Stack          |  []  used with  append/pop  |
| Queue          |  deque()                    |
| Linked List    | Nodes connected together    |
| Tree           | Hierarchical structure      |
| Heap           | Priority-based structure    |
| Graph          | Nodes + connections         |


